<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Cerner upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Cerner upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>DEERFIELD, Ill. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities analyst Benjamin Rooks said he upgraded Cerner Corp to buy from neutral.</p>
<p>Shares in the healthcare data management firm were up 5-1/8 to 26-5/8.</p>
<p>&quot;We believe the wind is finally at Cerner's back,&quot; Rooks said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
